      "summaries": {
        "en": "Qui is a lightweight web interface for qBittorrent that simplifies torrent management across multiple instances. Its technical innovation lies in being a single Go binary that eliminates complex dependencies while enabling automated workflows and cross-seeding between trackers. Developers can deploy it as a self-contained service to monitor torrents, create automation rules, and efficiently share content across different private trackers without manual intervention.",
        "zh": "Qui是一款专为qBittorrent设计的轻量级Web界面，解决了多实例种子客户端统一管理的难题。其技术亮点在于采用Go语言编译为单一可执行文件，无需复杂依赖即可运行，并通过自动化工作流实现跨追踪器的种子互传。用户可将其部署为独立服务，实时监控下载状态、设置自动化规则，并在不同私有追踪器间智能共享内容，特别适合需要高效管理大量种子的高级用户实验自动化种子分发策略。",
        "es": "Qui is a lightweight web interface for qBittorrent that simplifies torrent management across multiple instances. Its technical innovation lies in being a single Go binary that eliminates complex dependencies while enabling automated workflows and cross-seeding between trackers. Developers can deploy it as a self-contained service to monitor torrents, create automation rules, and efficiently share content across different private trackers without manual intervention.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "qui stands out for cross-seed, cross-seeding, and go in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Qui is a lightweight web interface for qBittorrent that simplifies torrent management across multiple instances. Its technical innovation lies in being a single Go binary that eliminates complex dependencies while enabling automated workflows and cross-seeding between trackers. Developers can deploy it as a self-contained service to monitor torrents, create automation rules, and efficiently share content across different private trackers without manual intervention.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/autobrr/qui for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
